# Deploy checklist

Production is Docker Compose on the Ubuntu host, not Kubernetes and not Laravel Cloud.

- `app`, `queue`, and `scheduler` share `shootingsports-app:latest`. Only `app` has a `build:` block.
- Migrations run in `docker/entrypoint.sh` for the app role. Queue and scheduler set `APP_RUN_MIGRATIONS_ON_BOOT=false`.
- The app healthcheck hits `/up`.
- Media stays on the mounted volume (`MEDIA_HOST_PATH`, default `/mnt/storage/shootingsports/media`).
- `.github/workflows/tests.yml` runs `php artisan test --compact` on push and pull request. Keep that job when editing the workflow.

Add a monitoring product only after something fails that `/up` and `storage/logs/laravel.log` cannot explain.
